      "summary_markdown": "- **Resolution hours is higher for opened after hours = true** \u2014 Median resolution hours is 51.7 for opened after hours = true versus 33.6 for false.\n- **Missed SLA concentrates in reassignment count = 3+** \u2014 Records with reassignment count = 3+ have a missed SLA rate of 29.4% versus 9.6% for reassignment count = 1 (3.1x).\n- **Made_sla is driven mainly by reassignment_count** \u2014 Among the drivers tested, reassignment_count explains the most of made_sla; reassignment_count has 0.7x the odds (where category != inquiry).\n- **Volume is concentrated in few cmdb ci name values** \u2014 Payments Gateway accounts for 39.0% of records (where priority = 1).\n- **Volume is concentrated in few cmdb_ci_name values** \u2014 Email Service accounts for 6.9% of records (where category != inquiry, reassignment_count > 0).\n- **Missed SLA concentrates in assignment group name = Network Operations** \u2014 Records with assignment group name = Network Operations have a missed SLA rate of 22.3% versus 11.7% for assignment group name = Cloud Platform (1.9x) (where category = network).\n- **Missed SLA concentrates in assignment group name = Network Operations** \u2014 Records with assignment group name = Network Operations have a missed SLA rate of 22.3% versus 10.0% for assignment group name = Storage and Backup (2.2x).\n- **Missed SLA concentrates in category = network** \u2014 Records with category = network have a missed SLA rate of 19.2% versus 12.2% for category = database (1.6x).",
